  "body": "Discover the perfect combination of space, style and comfort in this beautifully designed standalone home. Filled with natural sunlight and offering generous living spaces throughout, this modern home is ideal for families seeking quality, convenience and easy-care living.\r\n\r\nStep inside and be impressed by the bright, spacious open-plan living and dining area, complemented by a stylish modern kitchen with quality finishes. Large windows allow an abundance of natural light to flow throughout the home, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The ground floor also features a guest toilet and seamless access to an outdoor deck, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find three well-proportioned bedrooms, two modern bathrooms and a separate study, ideal for working from home. The master bedroom features its own ensuite and a private balcony, where you can unwind and enjoy lovely elevated views.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• Near-new standalone home – less than one year old\r\n• 10-Year Stamford Building Warranty\r\n• Spacious, sun-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n• 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms plus a separate study\r\n• Master bedroom with ensuite and private balcony\r\n• Stylish modern kitchen and contemporary bathrooms\r\n• Excellent natural light throughout\r\n• Outdoor deck for relaxing and entertaining\r\n• Zoned for the highly sought-after Murrays Bay intermediate and Rangitoto College\r\n\r\nLocation & Lifestyle\r\nConveniently located just a few minutes' drive to Browns Bay Centre, beautiful beaches, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, motorway and Albany shopping centre. Everything you need for comfortable everyday living is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nOffering the perfect balance of modern design, generous space, natural sunlight and low- maintenance living, this near-new standalone home is an opportunity not to be missed. Contact me today to arrange a private viewing!",
